Accessible Smart Map OTP modifications

Based on OpenTripPlanner 2.9.0, commit
9babe45ffc9327933129f705c648137ecd96cdbe
https://github.com/opentripplanner/OpenTripPlanner

The policy and API trees contain modified upstream Java source and new
policy metadata, source/build evidence, selected geometry and request identity
classes. The observer tree adds verification of loaded policy classes.
Original author and copyright notices in source and LICENSE are retained.
These modifications are provided under LGPL-3.0-or-later.

Changes add exact source metadata to native edges, direct-WALK restrictions,
per-request stairs preference, source/graph/runtime identity and ordered native
geometry evidence. Diagnostic path metadata is logged only at DEBUG level.
The direct-WALK implementation does not qualify transit access, egress or
transfers. Source absence and missing observations remain unknown.

Transit linking retains upstream island-selection criteria while preserving
isolated walking geometry. Coordinate transit requests exclude only small
street components proven to contain no transit stops.

COPYING and COPYING.LESSER include GPL-3.0-or-later and LGPL-3.0-or-later
texts from https://github.com/spdx/license-list-data/tree/main/text.

The root Dockerfile contains build and startup wiring. reviewed-lock.json
records the exact upstream application, sources and reviewed class bytes.
It is an artifact identity record, not a runtime configuration source.
